From 70683edd6c63898149a9beffd5ae795d4a693211 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:27:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Drop static where a header declares the symbol
 (SDK_PORT_3DS)

Headers declare these tables and functions with external linkage, and the
.c files then define them static. Metrowerks accepted that; GCC rejects a
static definition after a non-static declaration. Under SDK_PORT_3DS define
them without static, as the headers say. The original build is unchanged.
